jobs | [\u00a77.1](#71-entry--benchmark-burst) | D-0433 | D-0433 minimum independently verified jobs in the quick serving-entry burst. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_min_burst_blocks\\\"></a>`calibration_min_burst_blocks` | 600 blocks | [\u00a77.1](#71-entry--benchmark-burst) | D-0433 | D-0433 minimum chain-timed serving-entry burst (10 minutes at 1s blocks). yellowpaper \u00a77.1. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_min_utilization_ppm\\\"></a>`calibration_min_utilization_ppm` | 500_000 ppm | [\u00a77.1](#71-entry--benchmark-burst) |  | Sustained utilization threshold for burst acceptance. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_provisional_discount_ppm\\\"></a>`calibration_provisional_discount_ppm` | 900_000 ppm | [\u00a77.1](#71-entry--benchmark-burst) |  | HARD-tier provisional discount applied to attested SKU ceilings before min(empirical_burst_cap, discounted_sku_ceiling). yellowpaper \u00a77.1. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_lease_blocks\\\"></a>`calibration_lease_blocks` | 604_800 blocks | [\u00a77.2](#72-renewable-cap) | D-0433 | D-0433 renewable calibration-cap lease (7 days at 1s blocks). |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_renewal_min_verified_jobs\\\"></a>`calibration_renewal_min_verified_jobs` | 8 jobs | [\u00a77.2](#72-renewable-cap) | D-0433 | D-0433 minimum fresh one-shot Ghost canaries for quick restart/offline/periodic cap renewal. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_renewal_max_age_blocks\\\"></a>`calibration_renewal_max_age_blocks` | 600 blocks | [\u00a77.2](#72-renewable-cap) |  | Maximum miner-triggered renewal window (10 minutes at 1s blocks). |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_min_recalibration_interval_blocks\\\"></a>`calibration_min_recalibration_interval_blocks` | 600 blocks | [\u00a77.1](#71-entry--benchmark-burst) |  | Minimum interval between accepted initial calibrations (10 minutes at 1s blocks), preventing rapid cap replacement and strategic retry loops. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-calibration_max_gpu_inventory_entries\\\"></a>`calibration_max_g