a715.2](#152-onboarding-normative) | D-0413 | Denominator paired with validator_growth_numerator (109/100 = +9%/yr). yellowpaper \u00a715.2. |\\n\\n**Metering tripwire**\\n\\n| Parameter | Value | \u00a7 | Decision | Description |\\n|-----------|-------|---|----------|-------------|\\n| <a id=\\\"param-throughput_tripwire_gflops_per_sec\\\"></a>`throughput_tripwire_gflops_per_sec` | 2_000_000 G_n/s | [\u00a74.2](#42-the-op-count-model) | D-0405 | Reject (never clamp) any claim whose implied gn*1000/latency_ms exceeds this; reject-only, governable, default-on. yellowpaper \u00a74.2. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-soft_tier_spot_check_rate_ppm\\\"></a>`soft_tier_spot_check_rate_ppm` | 25_000 ppm | [\u00a77.1](#71-entry--benchmark-burst) |  | SOFT-tier channel spot-check exposure surfaced with the calibration snapshot event for quality-audit pricing. yellowpaper \u00a77.1. |\\n\\n**Compute-channel settlement**\\n\\n| Parameter | Value | \u00a7 | Decision | Description |\\n|-----------|-------|---|----------|-------------|\\n| <a id=\\\"param-refund_penalty_phi_percent\\\"></a>`refund_penalty_phi_percent` | 20 percent | [\u00a712.1](#121-sessions--attested-streaming--aggregate-settlement) | D-0422 | Static D-0422 penalty fraction phi on unused escrow for ambiguous early close; penalty routes 100% to burn/Foundation, never miner. |\\n| <a id=\\\"param-channel_max_settlement"
